 },
 {
  "text": "虚无 也别捂住眼睛",
  "en": "void or cover your eyes",
  "s": 3.14,
  "e": 4.62
 },
 {
  "text": "荒谬就是真相",
  "en": "The absurd is the truth,",
  "s": 4.62,
  "e": 5.9
 },
 {
  "text": "不是什么聪明的伪装",
  "en": "not a clever disguise",
  "s": 5.9,
  "e": 6.86
 },
 {
  "text": "挣扎本身",
  "en": "The struggle",
  "s": 6.86,
  "e": 7.64
 },
 {
  "text": "就是意义待的地方",
  "en": "itself is where meaning exists",
  "s": 7.64,
  "e": 9.28
 },
 {
  "text": "推那块石头 然后笑",
