  "s": 14.12,
  "e": 15.62
 },
 {
  "text": "怎么感受是你自己选的",
  "en": "you choose how to feel",
  "s": 15.62,
  "e": 16.66
 },
 {
  "text": "加缪说这毫无意义",
  "en": "Camus said it's pointless,",
  "s": 16.66,
  "e": 17.94
 },
 {
  "text": "可转折在这儿",
  "en": "but here's the twist",
  "s": 17.94,
  "e": 18.94
 },
 {
  "text": "接住这份",
  "en": "Embrace the",
  "s": 18.94,
  "e": 19.82
 },
 {
  "text": "荒谬 你就能和它共处",
  "en": "absurd and you co-exist",
  "s": 19.82,
  "e": 21.8
 },
 {
  "text": "人生是个谜",
  "en": "Life's a riddle,",
  "s": 21.8,
  "e": 22.9
 },
 {
  "text": "看不到答案",
  "en": "no answer in sight",
  "s": 22.9,
  "e": 23.84
 },
 {
  "text": "但这不代表你",
  "en": "But that doesn't mean you",
  "s": 23.84,
  "e": 25.22
 },
 {
  "text": "就该放弃",
  "en": "should give up the fight",
  "s": 25.22,
  "e": 26.12
 },
 {
  "text": "在爬的过程里找到快乐",
  "en": "Find joy in the climb,",
  "s": 26.12,
  "e": 27.5
 },
 {
  "text": "在使劲 在出汗里",
  "en": "in the effort to sweat",
  "s": 27.5,
  "e": 28.5
 },
 {
  "text": "你反抗的那一刻",
